---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getPublishedTools } from '../config/site';
const tools = getPublishedTools().filter((t) => t.category === 'Loans');
const count = tools.length;
const noindex = count < 4;
const jsonld = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    { '@type': 'CollectionPage', name: 'Loan Calculators', url: 'https://calcumetrics.com/loans', description: `${count} free loan calculators: EMI, home loan, car loan, and prepayment savings.` },
    { '@type': 'ItemList', itemListElement: tools.map((t, i) => ({ '@type': 'ListItem', position: i + 1, url: `https://calcumetrics.com${t.path}`, name: t.name })) },
    { '@type': 'BreadcrumbList', itemListElement: [{ '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://calcumetrics.com/' }, { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Loans', item: 'https://calcumetrics.com/loans' }] },
  ],
};
---
<Layout title={`Loan Calculators: ${count} Free Tools | Calcumetrics`} description={`${count} free loan calculators: EMI, home loan, car loan, and prepayment savings. See exact monthly payments and total interest. 100% client-side.`} canonical="https://calcumetrics.com/loans" robots={noindex ? 'noindex,follow' : 'index,follow,max-image-preview:large'} ogImage="/og/categories/loans.png" ogImageAlt="Calcumetrics Loan & Mortgage Calculators — EMI, Amortization, and Prepayment savings suite preview card">
  <Fragment slot="head"><script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(jsonld)} /></Fragment>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6"><ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-text-muted"><li><a href="/" class="hover:text-accent transition-standard">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">›</li><li class="text-text-primary font-medium" aria-current="page">Loans</li></ol></nav>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-2">Loan Calculators</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted mb-8 max-w-xl">Calculate your EMI, total interest, and repayment schedule for any loan. Plan prepayments to save on interest. All calculations run in your browser.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      {tools.map((tool) => (
        <a href={tool.path} class="group block bg-surface border border-border rounded-card p-4 hover:border-accent transition-standard focus-visible:outline-accent">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">{tool.region}</span>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-sm text-text-primary group-hover:text-accent transition-standard mb-1">{tool.name}</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed">{tool.description}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <section aria-labelledby="hub-guide" class="mt-12 max-w-3xl">
      <h2 id="hub-guide" class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">How to choose a loan calculator</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Use the <a href="/emi-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">EMI calculator</a> for any fixed-rate instalment loan, and the <a href="/home-loan-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">home loan</a> or <a href="/car-loan-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">car loan</a> calculator when you also want the down payment and total cost. US home buyers should use the <a href="/mortgage-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">mortgage calculator</a>.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Before you borrow, the <a href="/loan-affordability-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">loan affordability</a> and <a href="/debt-to-income-ratio-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">debt-to-income</a> calculators show how much a lender is likely to approve against your income. Once you have a loan, the <a href="/loan-amortization-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">amortization calculator</a> shows how each payment splits between interest and principal, and the <a href="/loan-prepayment-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">prepayment calculator</a> compares reducing the EMI with reducing the tenure.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">If you know the payment and loan amount but not the rate, the <a href="/interest-rate-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">interest rate calculator</a> finds the rate you are really paying. For card balances, the <a href="/credit-card-payoff-calculator" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">credit card payoff calculator</a> shows how long minimum payments take and what a higher payment saves.</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">For a vehicle quote, the <a href="/car-loan-calculator" class="text-accent font-medium hover:underline">car loan calculator with down-payment comparisons</a> shows how changing your upfront payment affects both EMI and total interest.</p>
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2 mt-6">Related guides</h3>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/blog/how-loan-amortization-works" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">How loan amortization works</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/increase-emi-or-extend-tenure-after-rate-hike" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Increase EMI or extend tenure after a rate hike?</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/debt-to-income-ratio-for-mortgage" class="text-accent hover:underline font-medium">Debt-to-income ratio limits for mortgages</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
